("Phone Photography Tips", "<p>Wipe your lens first — seriously. Shoot near windows for soft light; avoid harsh overheads. Tap to focus on faces, then slide exposure down slightly for richer colors. Edit lightly: warmth up, shadows up, done.</p>"),
